WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:06.507 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(impact de la balle)

00:00:04.371 --> 00:00:07.708 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est un son distinctif,

00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:12.145 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le contact du bâton avec

00:00:06.807 --> 00:00:13.380 size:53% position:73% line:53%
