00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:14.581 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et d'admiration.

00:00:12.446 --> 00:00:15.816 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Lorsque l'étouffante chaleur

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:17.050 size:53% position:73% line:53%
indienne s'estompe en fin

00:00:14.882 --> 00:00:18.252 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de journée, des milliers

00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:22.322 size:53% position:73% line:53%
