00:00:17.351 --> 00:00:23.524 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des bidonvilles aux plages

00:00:18.552 --> 00:00:24.725 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pittoresques.

00:00:22.623 --> 00:00:25.959 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Les écoles sont fermées

00:00:23.824 --> 00:00:27.194 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en raison de la pandémie.

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:30.163 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Muhammad en profite

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:31.365 size:53% position:73% line:53%
