00:01:30.324 --> 00:01:36.563 size:53% position:73% line:53%
professionnelle indienne.

00:01:34.828 --> 00:01:37.598 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 La Indian Premier League est

00:01:35.863 --> 00:01:38.632 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la sixième ligue sportive

00:01:36.864 --> 00:01:44.371 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la plus puissante de la planète

00:01:37.898 --> 00:01:45.372 size:53% position:73% line:53%
après la NFL et les grandes

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:46.406 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ligues de soccer en Europe.

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:47.441 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 La IPL devait offrir une

00:01:45.672 --> 00:01:48.442 size:53% position:73% line:53%
distraction, des moments

00:01:46.707 --> 00:01:49.476 size:53% position:73% line:53%
quotidiens de répit pendant

00:01:47.741 --> 00:01:50.477 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la pandémie, mais les activités

00:01:48.742 --> 00:01:51.511 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ont été suspendues le 4 mai.

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:57.718 size:53% position:73% line:53%
De plus en plus d'Indiens

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:58.752 size:53% position:73% line:53%
s'opposaient à la tenue

00:01:51.812 --> 00:01:59.753 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du tournoi.

00:01:58.018 --> 00:02:00.787 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "La ligue reprendra plus tard,

00:01:59.052 --> 00:02:04.358 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dit-il. iIl est plus important

00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:05.359 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de sauver notre pays et

00:02:01.088 --> 00:02:06.360 size:53% position:73% line:53%
nos citoyens en ce moment."

00:02:04.658 --> 00:02:07.394 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Pandémie ou pas, le cricket

00:02:05.659 --> 00:02:08.395 size:53% position:73% line:53%
continue de susciter

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.862 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la ferveur en Inde.

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:08.862 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ici Philippe Leblanc,

